# testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime: a check of a boxed value asks two things: is it of the type, and is a cell a text, a symbol, a bigint or an object. Each failing edge goes to the one way out of the check.
# No answer is made to meet another: the function has no join of its own, so no phi stands in its code.
# OPTIONS: testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime
# RUN(WALKED): walk f1 mechanisms=all
# WALKED: CheckProof {{*}} checkedType=string typeWithoutProof=absent|anything{{*}} source=Test
# WALKED: CheckProof {{*}} checkedType=undefined|null|boolean|number|symbol|bigint|object{{*}} source=Test
# RUN(EMITTED): emit f1 mechanisms=all
